                    For CNET and ABBS systems
                   and other one linelogfiles.

    -  -- ---===    MC Log File Stripper v0.1   ===--- -- -

              oO  Coded by Jotes MC Prod © 1995 Oo

---------------------- A MC Soft Production -------------------------

1. INFO
~~~~~~~

   This program will strip your logfiles to the spesified Kbytes from
   either cli or a config file... without destroying the structure of
   the log files.. It supports both abbs and cnet logfiles..


2. CONTENTS:
~~~~~~~~~~~~
 MCLFS     - THE log file stripper..
 MCLFS.DOC - This doc file.


3. USAGE: from CLI.
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 MCLFS [logfile] [kbytes] [quiet]

 [logfile] - The name and path of the logfile you want to strip.
 [kbytes]  - The size you want the logfile to be stripped down to.
 [quiet]   - Turn off output to screen.


4. USAGE: from config file mclfs.cfg.
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
MCLFS to run the program.

Here is an example of a config file that shows how to set it up..

-start-
abbs:node1logfile - abbs logfile
50                - kbytes
sysdata:calls     - cnet logfile
20                - kbytes
-end-

You can strip unlimited numbers of logfiles from the configfile if you
need to do that. The config file can not be commented in any way (yet!)..

